<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Copy for the portfolio (units) screen, owned by the units worker.

    One file per screen area, so two workers can add copy without editing one another's
    file. Keys are `units_*` and are mirrored in values-ru/strings_units.xml with real
    Russian; every name here exists in both locales, because a key with no translation
    falls back to English (slot.locales) and a placeholder is not a translation
    (locale.placeholder). No user-facing prose is compiled into Kotlin — every label
    reaches the screen through stringResource (locale.hardcoded).
-->
